title=How+to+Paint+Rust%2C+Chipping+and+Battle+Damage&slug=rust-and-battle-damage&content=%3Ch1%3EHow+to+Paint+Rust%2C+Chipping+and+Battle+Damage+on+Miniatures%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Paint+rust+in+three+layers+%E2%80%94+dark+brown+base+in+recesses%2C+orange-brown+texture+in+the+middle%2C+bright+metallic+chips+on+the+sharpest+edges+%E2%80%94+and+create+physical+damage+by+scoring+the+model+with+a+hobby+knife+before+painting.+Real+chips+show+bare+metal%2C+not+just+brown+paint.+That+metallic+flash+is+what+sells+the+effect.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDisclosure%3A+Some+links+on+this+page+are+affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+if+you+buy+through+them%2C+we+may+earn+a+small+commission+at+no+extra+cost+to+you.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EUnderstanding+Rust+Textures%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3ERust+is+not+one+colour+%E2%80%94+it%27s+a+gradient+from+fresh+metal+%28bright%29+through+oxidised+orange+to+deep+brown-black+crust.+The+location+matters+as+much+as+the+colour%3A+rust+blooms+where+water+collects+%28recesses%2C+panel+joins%2C+undersides%29+and+where+friction+strips+paint+%28edges%2C+handles%2C+walking+surfaces%29.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+1%3A+Base+Coat+and+Physical+Damage%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EBefore+any+paint%2C+decide+where+battle+damage+goes.+Then+create+real+texture%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EScrapes%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+drag+the+tip+of+a+hobby+knife+lightly+across+the+surface+%E2%80%94+paint+pools+in+the+grooves+and+reads+as+gouges%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDents%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+press+a+foam+ball+or+brush+handle+into+soft+plastic+for+craters%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EHoles%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+a+pin+drill+or+heated+needle+makes+clean+projectile+holes+on+vehicle+hulls%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3EPrime+dark.+The+physical+marks+now+hold+paint+differently+than+the+flat+surface+%E2%80%94+free+realism.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+2%3A+Apply+the+Rust+Tones%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDark+brown+base%3C%2Fstrong%3E+in+all+recesses+and+around+the+damage+%E2%80%94+this+is+the+shadow+of+the+rust%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EOrange-brown+midtone%3C%2Fstrong%3E+dabbed+on+with+a+sponge+or+stippled+with+a+ruined+brush%2C+covering+60%25+of+the+rust+zone%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBright+orange+highlights%3C%2Fstrong%3E+on+the+most+exposed+parts+of+the+rust+bloom%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Cp%3EKeep+it+stippled%2C+not+brushed+%E2%80%94+rust+never+has+smooth+edges.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStep+3%3A+Metallic+Edge+Highlights+on+Chips%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EEvery+chip+that+cuts+through+paint+should+show+%3Cstrong%3Ebare+metal%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A+a+tiny+dot+or+streak+of+bright+silver+on+the+chip%27s+sharpest+edge%2C+with+the+rust+tones+surrounding+it.+Sequence%3A+brown+crater+%E2%86%92+orange+halo+%E2%86%92+silver+core.+Two+colours+on+a+toothpick-sized+dot+is+enough.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EAdvanced%3A+Rust+Streaks+Under+Chips%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EGravity+drags+rust+downward+from+the+damage+point.+From+the+bottom+edge+of+each+chip%2C+draw+a+thin%2C+fading+line+of+orange-brown.+This+single+detail+moves+the+model+from+%22painted+rust%22+to+%22lived-in+machine.%22%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ERecommended+Weathering+Paints%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EProduct+type%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EUse%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3ELevel%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ERust+effect+paint+set%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EPre-mixed+orange%2Fbrown+spectrum%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBeginner%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EChipping+medium%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ELayer+trick%3A+paint+breaks+away+realistically%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EIntermediate%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EBright+silver+%28metallic%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EChip+cores+%E2%80%94+you%27ll+use+it+constantly%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EPigment+fixer%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ELocks+powdery+rust+dust%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAll%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3E%28Affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+buying+through+them+keeps+the+guides+free.%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+do+I+make+battle+damage+look+realistic%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EFollow+the+logic+of+damage%3A+chipping+on+edges+that+get+hit%2C+rust+where+moisture+sits%2C+fresh+metallic+on+%3Cem%3Enew%3C%2Fem%3E+damage+and+oxidised+tones+on+old.+Random+damage+everywhere+is+the+tell-tale+beginner+sign.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECan+battle+damage+be+done+without+a+hobby+knife%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes+%E2%80%94+sponge+chipping+with+dark+paint+fakes+physical+damage+convincingly.+But+real+scored+marks+add+shadow+depth+paint+alone+can%27t.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhich+primer+for+rust+effects%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EDark+grey+or+black.+Rust+tones+are+semi-transparent+and+dark+primer+gives+them+depth%3B+a+white+primer+washes+the+effect+out.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+much+battle+damage+should+one+model+have%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EVehicles%3A+5%E2%80%9310+spots.+Infantry%3A+2%E2%80%933+subtle+chips.+The+model+must+remain+readable+from+a+metre+away+%E2%80%94+damage+is+seasoning%2C+not+the+dish.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EContinue+on+the+Workbench%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Feasy-weathering-techniques%2F%22%3EEasy+Weathering+Techniques+for+Miniatures%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+sponge+chipping%2C+streaks+and+dust%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fworkbench%2Fbest-hobby-tools%2F%22%3EBest+Hobby+Tools+for+Miniature+Painting%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+knife+and+files+this+guide+assumes%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fchaotic-factions%2F%22%3EThe+Industrial+Zealots%3A+Faction+Lore%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+machine-cult+aesthetic+behind+the+rust%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Flore%2Fwarp-travel-explained%2F%22%3EWarp+Travel+Explained%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+why+lost+ships+come+back+rusted%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ERust+is+storytelling+in+paint.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Every+chip+says+what+happened+to+this+machine+%E2%80%94+decide+the+story+before+the+first+stroke.+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fshop%2Fweathering%2F%22%3EShop+rust+%26+weathering+paints+%E2%86%92%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%3Cem%3E%28affiliate+links%29%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E&status=publish